    <Program_Sub_Category>HTTP/FTP/Torrent Download Manager</Program_Sub_Category>
    <Program_Summary_Text>Turkish multi-segment download manager with torrent (aria2) and magnet link support</Program_Summary_Text>
    <Program_Description>
      Retro+ Download Manager is a free, open-source (MIT) download manager with:
      - Up to 32 parallel segments (HTTP Range)
      - Pause/resume/cancel from any point
      - Built-in aria2 torrent engine (magnet + .torrent files)
      - Download queue with concurrency limit
      - Hourly/daily scheduled downloads
      - Automatic file categories (Video, Music, Archives, Programs, Documents)
      - Web page media resolution (og:video, source, JSON-LD)
      - Playlist support (YouTube, DASH merge with yt-dlp + ffmpeg)
      - Site Grabber for batch queueing
      - FTP/FTPS support
      - Client-side speed limit
      - Browser bridge on 127.0.0.1:8877
      - Clipboard monitoring
      - Turkish interface
      - Portable Windows executable (no Python required)
    </Program_Description>
    <Program_Icon_URL>https://retro-download-manager.netlify.app/assets/icon.png</Program_Icon_URL>
